      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "Equity Duration (Dechow-Sloan-Soliman) quintile long-short"
    },
    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Dechow/Sloan/Soliman（RAS 2004）股权久期之 OpenSourceAP 可钉执行核。ROE=ib/滞后ceq；股权增长率=sale/滞后sale−1；现金分配CD=滞后ceq×(ROE−g)；以ρ_ROE=0.57、r=0.12、ρ_g=0.24、长期g=0.06向前投影1–10年ROE/g/BV/CD；MD_Part1=Σ t·CD_t/(1+r)^t，PV_Part1=Σ CD_t/(1+r)^t；EquityDuration=MD_Part1/ME+(10+(1+r)/r)·(1−PV_Part1/ME)，ME=prcc_f×csho。每年6月末：市值加权五分位，做多最低EquityDuration、做空最高（Sign为负），持有12月。不是BM/EP估值十分位；不是PctAcc/hire/Illiquidity/CompEquIss/OrderBacklog/GrSaleToGrInv近核。公式与代码见OpenSourceAP EquityDuration.py。"
    },
